-    "$$E_0^{(2)} = \\sum_{\\mu\\neq 0}\\frac{\\left|\\langle\\Psi_{0}^{HF}\\mid\\hat{V}\\mid\\Psi_{\\mu}^{HF}\\rangle\\right|^2}{E_0^{(0)} - E_{\\mu}^{(0)}}$$\n",
