+    "E_{\\rm 0,\\,OS}^{(2)} = \\sum_{ij}\\sum_{ab}\\frac{(ia\\mid jb)(ia\\mid jb)}{\\epsilon_i - \\epsilon_a + \\epsilon_j - \\epsilon_b},\n",
